{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22411","headline":"寄微之三首 一 · 白居易","name":"寄微之三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江州望通州，天涯与地末。\n有山万丈高，有江千里阔。\n间之以云雾，飞鸟不可越。\n谁知千古险，爲我二人设。\n通州君初到，郁郁愁如结。\n江州我方去，迢迢行未歇。\n道路日乖隔，音信日断绝。\n因风欲寄语，地远声不彻。\n生当复相逢，死当从此别。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22411.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22411","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}